<h1>Update Current CS</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from the <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu for Transformations &gt; Update Current CS</b></span>.</p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Update Current</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command updates the current co-ordinate system with the selected transformation. This command works with transformations only.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">The transformation will become Current CS and all non-locked entities will be automatically applied to that transformation.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP1046260488" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table class="TableGrid" style="margin-left:23.4pt; border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:5px;" cellspacing="5">
<col>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../User_Interface/Images/UpdateCCS1.gif" width="777px" height="374px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:center;" align="center">Scene before '3 spheres' transformation is made current CS.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:center;" align="center"><img src="../User_Interface/Images/UpdateCCS2.gif" width="777px" height="374px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="middle" class="whs4">
<td valign="top" class="whs5">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:center;" align="center">Scene after '3 spheres' transformation is made current CS. Non-locked entities (Scan, Sphere 1, Sphere 2, and Sphere 3) are affected by the transformation.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">When a transformation is applied to the current CS, this transformation also becomes active, which means that this is the co-ordinate system of the localiser.</p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">If there is some other active transformation (for example, T1) and we apply a transformation (for example, T2), then T2 will be added to T1, and the non-locked entities will be applied to the combined transformation of T1 + T2. The name in ‘Current CS:’ will be the name of T2.</p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Update Current CS</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">command to apply a transformation to all non-locked entities at once.</span></p>
